n\nValid driver's license\n\nWorking Conditions:\n\nRegularly required to operate a motor vehicle\n\nPlease note, if you are applying for a position located in California, please read the following: California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA) Notice for Employees and Applicants\n\nTo learn more about Ansco & Associates, visit our website.", "date": ""}]
</tool_response>

