[{"url": "https://www.dycomind.com/about-dycom", "content": "About Dycom | Dycom Industries\n\nAbout Dycom\n\nDycom Industries is an industry-leading provider of specialty contracting services. Through our family of subsidiary companies, Dycom provides engineering, design, construction, maintenance and installation services to telecommunications providers throughout the United States.\n\nOur Customers\n\nAT&T, Verizon, Comcast, Charter, and T-Mobile among others\n\nThrough our subsidiary companies, we provide:\n\nProgram management\nEngineering and design\nConstruction, maintenance, and installation services\nunderground facility locating\n\nDycom's Specialty Contracting Capabilities\n\nSpecialty contracting for telecommunications providers, including the design of outside plant fiber optic and copper wireline networks, the installation, splicing, and testing of fiber optic cables, the installation of inside plant central office equipment, the placement of buried and aerial cable, the installation and maintenance of customer premise equipment, and the maintenance of cable television systems.\n\nOur Vision\n{content truncated}
